WEBVTT

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:02.724
What if India had no
internet for seven days?

00:00:02.894 --> 00:00:03.984
Start with the basics.

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:06.380
No WhatsApp, no UPI, no maps.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.490
You couldn't book a cab or order food.

00:00:08.626 --> 00:00:09.396
Then work.

00:00:09.531 --> 00:00:11.741
Millions of people work from cloud tools.

00:00:11.892 --> 00:00:15.042
Offices that depend on email
and video calls would stop.

00:00:15.172 --> 00:00:17.342
Schools with online classes would close.

00:00:17.512 --> 00:00:22.152
Small businesses that sell on Instagram
or online stores would lose a full week of

00:00:22.152 --> 00:00:22.842
sales.

00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:26.958
Hospitals, banks and airlines also
depend on networks to run properly.

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:28.358
A lot would slow down.

00:00:28.439 --> 00:00:30.989
We use the internet all day,
without thinking.

00:00:31.044 --> 00:00:33.834
So what if India had no
internet for seven days?

